msgctxt "HowToPage:2371:0:4"
msgid "The <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Role</ui-edge-color></ui-color> section has been added to <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Actions & Traits</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, found under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Character</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>main menu</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Selecting it will display the role actions you have learned."
msgstr "Раздел <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Роль»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> добавлен в окно <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Действия и свойства»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, которое находится в разделе <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Персонаж»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>главного меню</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Здесь можно посмотреть изученные ролевые действия."

#. ja: 楽器を使い音を奏でる<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「楽器演奏」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>が開放されました。<br><br>楽器演奏は、アクションリストの<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「PERFORM」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>内にある音色アクションを<br>実行し、画面上に表示される鍵盤を使って<br>様々な音を奏でることができます。<br><br>あなたの想いをメロディに乗せて、<br>演奏してみましょう♪
#. de: Du kannst deine Freunde nun mit eigenen <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kompositionen</ui-edge-color></ui-color> erfreuen!<br>Starte im Kommandomenü unter „Kompositionen“ das Kommando für den gewünschten Klang und spiele die Noten auf der Bildschirmtastatur.
#. fr: Vous pouvez désormais utiliser les <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Actions d'interprétation</ui-edge-color></ui-color> <nbsp>!<br>Accédez à la fenêtre Actions et traits pour enregistrer les Actions d'interprétation correspondant aux différents instruments sur votre barre d'actions. Il vous suffira alors de cliquer dessus pour afficher le clavier et laisser libre cours à votre inspiration en jouant les mélodies qu'il vous plaira<nbsp>!
#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-edge-color> — end of: text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: </ui-color> — end of: text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "HowToPage:2380:0:4"
msgid "Use your harp to create sweet, sweet music by selecting a sound from <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Performance</ui-edge-color></ui-color> located under <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Actions & Traits</ui-edge-color></ui-color> in the main menu. Then, simply use the keyboard to create your masterpiece! Remember, performance actions can only be used while your job is set to bard."
msgstr "Выберите звук в разделе <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Исполнение»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> меню <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Действия и свойства»</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, чтобы заиграть на арфе мелодию. А затем просто нажимайте клавиши на экране и творите! Учтите: действия исполнения доступны только в роли менестреля."

#. ja: マスク・ド・ローズの出すテーマに従い、<br>ファッションを整えて、採点を受ける、<br>それが、<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「ファッションチェック」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>です。<br><br>テーマは週ごとに変わります。<br>その週のテーマは、<br>（地球時間）<reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時に発表され<br>（地球時間）<reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>日<case>月<case>火<case>水<case>木<case>金<case>土</switch>曜日の<if ($hour >= 12)>午後<else>午前</if><if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{0}<case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}</switch><else>{0}</if>時から<br>採点が開始されます。<br>　　　　　　　　　　　次のページへ》
#. de: Die <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Kleiderkritik</ui-edge-color></ui-color> ist ein zwangloser Wettbewerb, bei dem Maskierte Rose Themen vorgibt, zu denen du dich entsprechend kleidest und dich dann vom Meister des guten Geschmacks persönlich bewerten lässt. Das Thema der Kleiderkritik ändert sich jede Woche <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch> um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit). Der eigentliche Wettbewerb beginnt jede Woche <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>Sonntag<case>Montag<case>Dienstag<case>Mittwoch<case>Donnerstag<case>Freitag<case>Samstag</switch> um <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>:00 Uhr (Erdenzeit).
#. fr: L'intransigeant Masked Rose veut évaluer votre sens du style pour la Revue de mode<nbsp>! Habillez-vous en fonction du thème hebdomadaire annoncé tous les <reset-time 17 2><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel) et présentez-vous devant le célèbre critique de mode à partir des <reset-time 17 5><switch $weekday><case>dimanches<case>lundis<case>mardis<case>mercredis<case>jeudis<case>vendredis<case>samedis</switch> à <if $hour><switch $hour><case>{1}<case>{2}<case>{3}<case>{4}<case>{5}<case>{6}<case>{7}<case>{8}<case>{9}<case>{10}<case>{11}<case>{12}<case>{13}<case>{14}<case>{15}<case>{16}<case>{17}<case>{18}<case>{19}<case>{20}<case>{21}<case>{22}<case>{23}</switch><else>{0}</if>h (temps réel).
