#. macro: <ui-color 500> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 500 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 501> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 501 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
msgctxt "HowToPage:2593:0:4"
msgid "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Beastmasters</ui-edge-color></ui-color> fight alongside their familiars. To gain familiars, you must <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>befriend beasts</ui-edge-color></ui-color> by using the action <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Capture</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Using this action upon a weakened target may increase its success rate. Furthermore, the action <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Gauge</ui-edge-color></ui-color> will assess your chances of befriending a targeted beast."
msgstr "<ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>Укротители чудовищ</ui-edge-color></ui-color> сражаются вместе с питомцами. Чтобы завести питомца, используйте действие <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Захват»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> и <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>приручите зверя</ui-edge-color></ui-color>. Если цель ослаблена, шанс успеха выше. Действие <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>«Оценка»</ui-edge-color></ui-color> покажет, насколько легко приручить выбранного зверя."

#. ja: 仲間にしたモンスターは、<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「魔獣図鑑」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>に記録されます。<br><br>魔獣図鑑は、メインコマンドの<br><ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>「マイキャラクター」</ui-edge-color></ui-color>から「魔獣図鑑」を<br>選択することで開くことができます。<br><br><br><br>　　　　　　　　　　　次のページヘ》
#. de: Gebändigte Bestien werden in deinem <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Bestienbuch</ui-edge-color></ui-color> verzeichnet, das du unter <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Charakter</ui-edge-color></ui-color> im <ui-color 500><ui-edge-color 501>Hauptmenü</ui-edge-color></ui-color> findest.
#. fr: Une fois capturée, la bête sera ajoutée dans le <ui-color 506><ui-edge-color 507>bestiaire de dresseur</ui-edge-color></ui-color>, accessible depuis l'option Personnage du menu principal.
#. macro: <ui-color 506> — text color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-color> restores the previous color; color = 506 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
#. macro: <ui-edge-color 507> — text outline color from the UIColor sheet; </ui-edge-color> restores the previous color; color = 507 (formatting: keep it as often as the source has it)
